{"id":"word:hebrew:H1368","type":"word","title":"גִּבּוֹר","subtitle":"H1368 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"powerful ; by implication, warrior , tyrant","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to גִּבּוֹר (H1368) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 160 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"גִּבּוֹר (gibbôwr) means powerful ; by implication, warrior , tyrant First listed occurrence: 1Chr 1 10."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"גִּבּוֹר","transliteration":"gibbôwr","pronunciation":"ghib-bore'","strong":"H1368","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1368","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["גִּבּ֥וֹר","גִּבּ֣וֹר","גִּבּוֹרֵ֣י","הַ/גִּבֹּרִֽים","גִּבּ֣וֹרֵי"],"morphs":[["HAampc",32],["HAamsa",24],["HTd/Aampa",21],["HAampa",20],["HAamsc",18],["HR/Aamsa",9],["HTd/Aamsa",6],["HRd/Aampa",5],["HC/Td/Aampa",3],["HAampc/Sp2ms",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"powerful ; by implication, warrior , tyrant","usage":"champion, chief, × excel, giant, man, mighty (man, one), strong (man), valiant man.","full":"H1368. gibbor גִּבּוֺר 159 adjective strong, mighty (compare Arabic one who magnifies himself, behaves proudly, a tyrant, who is bold, audacious ) — Gen 10:9 5 t.; גִּבֹּר 10:8 2 t.; גִּבּוֺרָם 1Sam 17:51 ; plural גִּבּוֺרִים Jer 46:9 27 t.; גִּבֹּרִים Josh 10:2 21 t.; construct גִּבּוֺרֵי 1Chr 11:27 29 t.; גִּבֹּרֵי 9:26 4 t.; suffix גִּבּוֺרֶיךָ Hosea 10:13 + (variant reading suffixes 11 t.); — 1. adjective בַּבְּהֵמָה גִּבּוֺר mightiest among beasts Prov 30:30 ; גִּבּוֺר אִישׁ 1Sam 14:52 ; בָּאָרֶץ גִּבּוֺר Psa 112:2 ; צַיִד גִּבּוֺר mighty in hunting Gen 10:9 (J); גבור מלך Dan 11:3 ; גִּבּוֺר אֵל the Messiah Isa 9:5 ; attribute of God especially as fighting for his people Psa 24:8 (twice in verse); Deut 10:17 ; Neh 9:32 ; Isa 10:21 ; Jer 32:18 (compare Arabic ). 2. noun masculine strong, valiant man Josh 10:2 (E) Gen 6:4 ; 10:8 (J) Judg 5:13 , 23 ; 1Sam 2:4 16 t. 1Kin 1:8 , 10 ; 2Kin 24:16 ; 1Chr 1:10-11 t. Ezra 7:28 ; Job 16:14 ; Psa 19:6 ; 33:16 ; 45:4 ; 52:3 ; 78:65 ; 89:20 ; 120:4 ; 127:4 ; Prov 16:32 ; 21:22 ; Song 3:7 (twice in verse); 4:4 ; Eccl 9:11 ; Isa 3:2 ; 13:3 ; 21:17 ; 42:13 ; 49:24-25 , Jer 5:16-17 t. Ezek 32:12 5 t. Hosea 10:13 ; Joel 2:7 ; Joel 4:9; Joel 4:10; Joel 4:11; Amos 2:14 , 16 ; Obadiah 9; Nahum 2:4 ; Zeph 1:14 ; 3:17 ; Zech 9:13 ; 10:5 , 7 ; compare phrases חיל גִּבּוֺר mighty man of valour Judg 6:12 ; 11:1 ; 1Sam 9:1 ; 16:18 ; 1Kin 11:28 ; 2Kin 5:1 ( מְצֹרָ֑ע חַיִל גִּבּוֺר הָיָה וְהָאִישׁ so ᵐ5 and others; but ᵐ5 L ὁ ἄνθρωπος ἦν λεπός , compare also Klo's dubious emendation), 1Chr 12:28 ; 28:1 ; 2Chr 13:3 ; 17:16-17 , 25:6 ; 32:21 ; חיל גבור אישׁ Ruth 2:1 ; החיל גבורי Josh 1:14 (D) 6:2 ; 10:7 (JE) 2Kin 15:20 ; 24:14 ; החיל גבורי אישׁ Josh 8:3 ; חיל גברי 1Chr 5:24 14 t. Neh 11:14 ; חילים גבורי 1Chr 7:5 , 7 , 11 , 40 ; החילים גבורי 11:26 ; כח גברי Psa 103:20 ; מלחמה גבורי 2Chr 13:3 ; השֹׁערים גברי 1Chr 9:26 ; הגבורים בית Neh 3:16 ; הגבורים (ה)צָבָא 2Sam 10:7 ; 1Chr 19:8 ; הגברים ראשׁי 11:10 ; לשׁתות גבורים valiant to drink Isa 5:22 .","rootNote":"or גִּבֹּר ; (shortened) intensive from the same as 1397 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 10","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 10","1Chr 5 24","1Chr 7 2","1Chr 7 5","1Chr 7 7","1Chr 7 9","1Chr 7 11","1Chr 7 40"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":160,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גִּבּ֖וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גִּבּ֣וֹרֵי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampc"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גִּבּ֥וֹרֵי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampc"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":5,"engli